name: Recyclomancy — extra discards
author: corpus
description: >-
  Recyclomancy permanently gives +2 discards each round. Tier-2 voucher: requires Wasteful
  bought first, so the earliest practical target is Ante 2. RAG aliases: extra discards,
  Yorick fuel, Castle scaling, discard engine.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - voucher: Recyclomancy
    antes: [2]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
should:
  - joker: Yorick
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Castle
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Drunkard
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
